"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"BS7OnkMycH8tD3Bqpz2FAQ","review_id":"iDcaL73LC1QqA-o0xFfkhA","date":"2014-08-17T18:27:12","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9327271580696106,"text_excerpt":"This place fills a real void in the area! Cute space, excellent food with amazing vegan options. I'm not even close to a vegan but I have loved everything I get on the menu and the prices are reasonable. The vegan blt is my go to and I love their \"toasts\". Their homemade dressings/condiments are delicious. And the staff is super nice. Definitely my favorite coffee shop that also has healthy delicious food."},{"business_id":"BS7OnkMycH8tD3Bqpz2FAQ","review_id":"DDygqGD73ryA2mRR7A8lTQ","date":"2015-08-26T16:39:27","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9257528781890869,"text_excerpt":"I LOVED Hivolt Coffee. We stopped for a late lunch after strolling along the boutiques at Magazine Street. The place had a hipster vibe, with retro artwork hanging everywhere and lots of people sitting around with coffee and laptops. The food was delicious. We ordered the Ozzy Plate and the Roasted Garden from the breakfast menu. This was the best meal I had in New Orleans; the poached eggs were perfect and the roasted vegetables from the Roasted Garden were just the right amount of savory. We also had a rosemary lemon soda, which was refreshing and sweet on a hot summer day. I actually read the drink as rosemary lemonade, not realizing it was soda (I personally dislike carbonated drinks)..."},{"business_id":"BS7OnkMycH8tD3Bqpz2FAQ","review_id":"ELAf5lZM9Vkax1Co90TIdA","date":"2014-09-25T01:01:43","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9255361557006836,"text_excerpt":"Went there today for a long study session with lunch and caffeine. They have an extensive coffee menu and a limited lunch menu, however, the poached chicken salad was very good! made on the spot with fresh ingredients and their version of a green goddess dressing (with dill, which I am not a huge fan of, but still thought it was great!). Sat their for several hours with intermittent purchases to justify my time and never felt pressured to leave. They have quite a few tables for a rather small, but open and light area. Didn't feel crowded. Baristas were nice and unobtrusive, not pretentious in anyway. Would definitely come again."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"BS7OnkMycH8tD3Bqpz2FAQ","photo_id":"FjmCf9WJ9rwFiKTLxWc0Ww","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/FjmCf9WJ9rwFiKTLxWc0Ww.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8591048717498779},{"business_id":"BS7OnkMycH8tD3Bqpz2FAQ","photo_id":"3xMf1OKZ3MV4fHhHv8UHLw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/3xMf1OKZ3MV4fHhHv8UHLw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8434003591537476},{"business_id":"BS7OnkMycH8tD3Bqpz2FAQ","photo_id":"krvTbsx_i3VnpuiiHS0B1A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/krvTbsx_i3VnpuiiHS0B1A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8397446870803833},{"business_id":"BS7OnkMycH8tD3Bqpz2FAQ","photo_id":"eUBzgahG7QnGCVEzP-5zxQ","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/eUBzgahG7QnGCVEzP-5zxQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8026955127716064},{"busines